/ RESULT IN READING A BLOCK FROM DISK INTO THE ETX BUFFER.

	AC0001		/SET Go To page FLaG TO				/A012
	DCA	GTFLG	/INDICATE A GO-TO-PAGE REQUEST			/A012
	JMP 	RPINEX	/EXIT:POINTERS ALL SET FOR RANDOM READ

GTFLG,	0		/SET TO INDICATE A GO-TO-PAGE REQUEST		/A012

RPDSCP,
	TAD	ONE	/SKIP TO READ DESCRIPTOR			/M025
	SZA 		/
	JMP	RPCNT	/JUMP TO TEST FURTHUR
