/D042 	TAD I T1	/						/A007
/D042 	CDFMYF		/BACK TO THIS FIELD
/D042 			/WITH DESCRIPTOR WORD IN AC....

	JMS	RPTPDS	/GET TOP GOTO-PAGE DESCRIPTOR WORD		/A042

