RPCNT,	TAD	ONE	/TEST FOR # OF PAGES IN STX BUFFER		/M025
	SZA 		/SKIP TO PASS THE # OF PAGES IN THE STX BUFFER
	JMP	RPTOP	/MAY BE REQUEST FOR ORIGONAL SCTOP & HDR ID#
/
/  AC was -2.....
/
	TAD	SCTOP	/SAVE POINTER TO CURRENT TOP BLOCK
	DCA	EDTOPS	/AT START OF TOTAL PAGE CALCULATION		/M041
	TAD	SCBOT	/AND CURRENT BOTTOM BLOCK POINTER
	DCA	EDBOTS							/M041
	TAD	SCTPH	/SAVE CURRENT 'TOP' HDR ID			/A020
	DCA	EDHDR							/A020
	TAD	SCBTH	/SAVE CURRENT 'BOTTOM' HDR ID			/A020
