	JMS	H2ECHK	/break?	/ issue BREAK if comm errors		/A066
	AC0003			/ ENABLE SOME 'RUPTS.			/A041

	IFNDEF CONDOR < JMS	USIOT >					/A075

	H2KIE			/ ENABLE RECIEVER INTERRUPTS.		/A066

