/THERE IS NO APPARENT REASON TO DO AN ERASE TO END OF LINE SO WE
/CAN MAKE THESE TWO COMMAND STRINGS TO IOA THE SAME. ALSO, THIS LITTLE
/CHANGE FIXES THE PROBLEM OF PACKET ERRORS WHEN THE 278 IS RECEIVING
/A DOCUMENT AT GREATER THAN 600 BAUD. THERE IS STILL A PROBLEM AT 19200
/BAUD. SOMEONE SHOULD LOOK AT IOA TO SEE HOW IT IS DOING THE ERASE TO
/END OF LINE AS IT IS THE CULPRIT. WE APPARENTLY LOOSE INPUT CHARACTERS
/FROM THE HOST WHEN DOING THE ERASE TO END OF LINE IN A 278	/A009

