	JMS	RESPAN		/ restore here if return 2		/a058
	JMP 	TSTXIT		/ and exit				/a058
TSTJB1,	JMS	RESPAN		/ restore swap   			/a058
	JMP	TSTJOB		/ cont					/a058
	
