	JMP	AXSP 		/ RETURN SINCE SPFLAG IS SET
	JMP	AXTO 		/ TIMED OUT
/
	TAD	(-TYPPAN) 	/ LOOKING FOR AN ANSWER TO THE PROMPT SENT
	SZA CLA 		/ ++++
	JMP	AXEJ4
/
