	DCA CUSRFO	
	DCA ORDER		
	DCA STATUS
	DCA DSKID					/A007
	CDFMNU		
	TAD I (FNAMSP	/THIS IS THE ADDRESS OF A BUFFER TO HOLD
			/THE DOCUMENT ADDRESS

	CDFMYF		
