/ called by: JMS RTNWT; WRONG RETURN; OK RETURN

RTNWT,	XX
	CIFMNU			/
	  JMS I	INACAL		/
		INBUF		/ INPUT BUFFER TO RECEIVE INPUT
	  JMP	.-3		/					/a025
