/ 007	DIM	3-SEPT-81	Merge Dutch forin changes

/ 006	GDH	26-AUG-81	WPFILS calling seq changes.

/ 005	DSS	17-APR-81	Addition of accented character
/				handling code for foreign systems.

/ 004	JM	11-MAR-81	Added CANADIAN text

/ 003	JM	09-MAR-81	Added DUTCH text

/ 002	JM	06-MAR-81	Added FRENCH text

/ 001	JM	06-MAR-81	Replaced all instances of '<' and
