	CLA								/A031
	CDFSYS			/ CLEAR HALT SWITCH SO NEXT		/A031
	DCA I HLTFLG		/ CALL TO READ DOESN'T FIND IT		/A031
				/ CHAR GET ROUTINE RESETS DATA FIELD
	JMP	CUNOR1		/ TRY AGAIN				/A026

