	DCA T3

	TAD CUDNUM		/ CONSTRUCT DIRECTORY ADDRESS
	TAD CUDGBB		/ ADDRESS OF CUDBUF
	DCA T1

	TAD CUDNUM		/ TEST FOR ID
	TAD (CUUDID
	CIA
	TAD I T3
