	JMP I	CUDGCR


/	CUDSTR
/	STORE A CHARACTER AWAY IN A UDK
/	CALLED WITH CHAR TO STORE IN AC:
/	JMS	CUDSTR  OR  JMS I CUDSTX			/C024
/	NO MORE ROOM RETURN (AC=0)
/	REGULAR RETURN (AC=0)
/
CUDSTR,	0 			/ POINTED TO BY CUDSTX		/C024
