/D033	JMP CUDST1		/ NO

	DCA I	CUDPTR 		/ STORE CHAR
	JMS  I	CUDSLX		/ (CUDSLM) TO GET NEXT BUFFER		/C027
	NOP
	IAC
	TAD CUDPTR		/ GOING TO INSERT TERMINATING 0
	DCA T1
	DCA I T1
/D033	ISZ	CUDSTR		/M0014
	JMP I	CUDSTR 		/ YES, RETURN


