/ {UDK}(M){RETURN}:	WHERE (M) IS 0-99. A UDK ENTRY
/ C+1:	GOLD HALT
/ C+2:	ILLEGAL INPUT
/ C+3:	KEYSTROKE IN AC

CUDDG0,
	0
	JMS I CUDGCX		/ CHAR INPUT				/C031
